Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hotel Mythos"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:00:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.83,0:01:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm fine. Please don't be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.95,0:01:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who found this coin, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Academic Advisor"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"The AC is broken"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure you're okay with that, Kagaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think turning it\Ndown is a bit of a waste?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grades are certainly good enough for...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you might be giving me too much credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Kagaya. Well, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a long trip every day, from this town--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.41,0:03:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd have to find a dorm or something\Nnear the college, and you'd be living alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry about that.\NWe can help you work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd like to think things over a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Gaio University" "Kuroyama Gakuin University"\N"Nanyou University" "Nimoku University"\N"Oseda University"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kagaya, did you find\Nsomething you want to pursue?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:04:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's normal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.87,0:04:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Kaga? Did you get a recommendation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I shouldn't set my sights so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Well, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Kagaya!\NCan you show me your work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.37,0:04:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--What is it, Nana?\N--You know his recommendation\Nwas just denied, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hmm? Oh, nothing.\N--You know his recommendation\Nwas just denied, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Who wants to go to college anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--Normal is best.\N--Who wants to go to college anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,--Being the same as everyone\Nelse makes me feel calm.\N--Let's get temp jobs! That's where the fun is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--I don't need to "be myself."\N--You can polish lenses in factories!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.37,0:04:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I'm way too tired for gym class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.62,0:04:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running a marathon today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.04,0:04:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously? It's hot as hell, are they crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.75,0:04:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just pretend not to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to stick your neck out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.45,0:05:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The number you are trying\Nto reach is no longer in service.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please confirm the number and dial again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.45,0:05:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, be back in a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Nana!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it got hit by a car\Nor something. Stupid {\i1}tanuki{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your underwear...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.66,0:05:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.79,0:05:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaga, you're looking right at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to be more subtle, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kagaya, you creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Her wrist snap on that throw was so sharp...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.08,0:06:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.83,0:06:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mifune!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?\NI got a college recommendation!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, congrats--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I didn't think\Nmy chances were great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what my mom said when I told her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Congratulations!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm going to get back to cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It was supposed to be you, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The one to get the recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your skill that got the recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got mud on your pants.\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I no longer have\Nany problems with my vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes just seemed\Nto get better out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.29,0:07:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. My body,\Nfor some reason... At some point...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to call 119!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.33,0:07:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone... inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.33,0:08:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Don't stick your neck out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But... There's a beast inside me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how I got this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I have this sense of smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.91,0:08:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This strange, monstrous form!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:09:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And of all the things I could\Ntransform into, why a stuffed animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all so crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough. Stay focused, save this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to move,\Nand my field of vision is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to mess around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.95,0:09:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell have I become?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.62,0:09:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it allowed me to rescue her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"The beast has saved the day!"\NOr something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,More like, "the cute mascot has saved the day!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was useful this time.\NI guess that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And nobody saw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? Her smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.75,0:10:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Our next story--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.33,0:11:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning, before dawn,\Na possible arsonist fire broke out
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,at a small industrial garage\Nin the logging district.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"Fire at logging building\Nin the mountains-- Arson?"\Nat a small industrial garage\Nin the logging district.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.25,0:11:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"Fire at logging building\Nin the mountains-- Arson?"\NThere do not appear to be\Nany related deaths or injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Fire at logging building\Nin the mountains-- Arson?"\NAccording to the fire department,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh wow, that's pretty close. How scary.\N--evidence at the scene indicated\Nkerosene had been spread around,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.41,0:11:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh wow, that's pretty close. How scary.\N--and authorities have begun\Ninvestigating a potential arson.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is my phone gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Did I leave it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--If the cops investigate me,\Nand my secret gets out...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.00,0:11:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey!\N--If the cops investigate me,\Nand my secret gets out...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.95,0:11:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh, hi!\N--If the cops investigate me,\Nand my secret gets out...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi Kagaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your phone, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody believed me. I thought I might be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.41,0:12:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you were hiding right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I ask you some questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but be curious...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...about a monster like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Her smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.58,0:13:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stay focused!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get my phone back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping that if everyone\Nfound out who you really are,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.37,0:13:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you might go on a rampage here at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a little disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for picking up my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.20,0:13:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh. You sound so sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:14:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But what exactly do you mean by "monster"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she saw me in my transformed state,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no proof that that was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And think about the state she was in.\NShe probably wasn't fully conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.91,0:14:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe if I pretend she was hallucinating...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.29,0:14:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I asked this morning,\Ndid you see something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! I guess I've made a mistake.\NHere's your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.95,0:14:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.12,0:14:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster that almost violated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile for the camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.37,0:15:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. You're more handsome in this form.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.16,0:15:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mind standing out here in plain sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Nana?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I just imagine that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a real gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.50,0:15:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know! I think it's a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! If someone sees me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Not until you tell me about this form.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, I'll tell\Neveryone that you're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How will people react if\Nthey find out monsters are real?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be famous, get to be on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.70,0:16:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you might get sliced up like a lab rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.41,0:16:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be left alive,\Nswarmed over like some kind of toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything! Really. Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It just started out of nowhere.\NThe transforming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:17:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then. But if you're lying,\NI'll be very upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I just realized I haven't introduced myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.41,0:17:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Clair Aoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What a trashy-- I mean, what a fancy name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a first year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's younger than me? And by two years!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Shuichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.70,0:17:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a little soon to use my first name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.29,0:17:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I've never seen it. Is it a coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be related\Nto you monsters somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"You monsters"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:17:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't know, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on in. This is my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.75,0:18:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Make yourself at home.\NI'm the only one who lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it was so hot out there. I hate summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All the bugs... And if you're\Nnot careful, you get sunburned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my first time in a girl's room.\NOr, I mean, home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Changing, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Changing...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All that stress made me sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she one of those nudists?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she still has her underwear on...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.41,0:18:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevermind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing to be embarrassed about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Completely unavoidable in a situation like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.45,0:19:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A perfectly natural biological\Nreaction for a mature male.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.20,0:19:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good boy and wait there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you move, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.95,0:19:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, you've got to do as I say now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.25,0:19:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for me, you'd have died!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.41,0:19:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You completely ruined my suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, nobody believed me\Nwhen I told them monsters are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I finally found one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair, what are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll help me, won't you, Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.54,0:20:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, they're an enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.79,0:20:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you? Barging in like that--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.29,0:20:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Coin... You mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You want it, so you must know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Psh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.66,0:20:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'd like to share.\NWhat the hell is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.37,0:20:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The coin...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.79,0:20:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange for power, you lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.95,0:20:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.79,0:21:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't kill her now, Shuichi.\NI've got some questions for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not going to kill her!\NWhy would I do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold still!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.45,0:21:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a step back here.\NWhy don't you introduce yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, out with it. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it. You guys are gatherers, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I don't need this, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.62,0:21:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care who comes for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Or how many of you there are...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.87,0:21:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rip you apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.66,0:21:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're... like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.25,0:22:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.58,0:23:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 2: What It Means to Be Empty"
